# ─── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem
*-credentials.json
*-session.json

# ─── Personal / machine-local config ─────────────────────────────────────
# CLAUDE.md is the maintainer's local instructions for the Claude Code CLI;
# .mcp.json points the MCP CLI at this machine's paths. Both are personal
# and not portable — keep them out of the repo. See .mcp.example.json for
# a template a tester can copy to .mcp.json.
CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json

# Agent-tool local state. `.claude/settings.local.json` holds machine-local
# permissions and `.claude/worktrees/` can contain a full second copy of the
# repo — a reflexive `git add .` would commit both.
.claude/
.codex/

# macOS launchd plists with hardcoded maintainer paths.
scripts/com.*.plist

# ─── Node / build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Note: we deliberately do NOT ignore `build/` — electron-builder reads
# installer assets (build/icon.png, build/icon.ico, build/entitlements.mac.plist,
# NSIS scripts, etc.) from that folder by convention. Add those when needed.
node_modules/
dist/
release/
out/
.cache/
.runtime/

# ─── Demo / capture artifacts (may contain real prospect data) ──────────────
exports/
*.traineddata
mcp-reel.html
.parcel-cache/

# ─── Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Runtime data + captures (regenerate locally; never commit) ──────────
# Agent personas are per-install state: agent-persona-store.js reads and writes
# `personas/<agentId>/` under the app directory, so anything committed here
# would ship as a pre-made agent in a fresh clone. A clone must start with no
# agents. The store mkdir's the directory on first write.
personas/
screenshots/
profile-screenshots/
sessions/
profiles.json
storage-state*.json

# Loose error screenshots dropped at repo root
error_connect_*.png
connection-dialog.png

# Loose ad-hoc temp files
/tmp/
tmp/
*.tmp

# ─── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ─── Test artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
junit.xml

# ─── Electron-builder cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.electron-builder/
electron-builder.env

# ─── Unrelated scaffolding parked in this folder ─────────────────────────
# Different project (Go-based "orion") that shares the directory. Not part
# of this Electron app.
.codex-orion-scaffold/
.codex-orion-spec/
.codex-orion-sync/

# ─── Internal planning / strategy docs ───────────────────────────────────
# Keep these out of the code repo. Move to a separate private doc store if
# you want a developer tester to read them.
LINKEDIN_2026_*.md
LINKEDIN_PRIVATE_API_NOTES.md
CROSS_CHANNEL_CAMPAIGN_*.md
ENGINEERING_EXECUTION_PLAN.md
SDR_AGENT_PRIORITY_TASK.md
REDESIGN_HANDOFF.md
OPENCLAW_AGENT.md
OPENCLAW_API_CALLS.md
